NC Digital builds custom ecommerce websites for businesses across Mid Wales — online stores designed around your brand and built to sell. Based in Merthyr Tydfil, we work with clients across Wales including [Aberystwyth](/ecommerce-web-design-aberystwyth/), [Newtown](/ecommerce-web-design-newtown/), [Welshpool](/ecommerce-web-design-welshpool/), [Llandrindod Wells](/ecommerce-web-design-llandrindod-wells/), [Brecon](/ecommerce-web-design-brecon/), [Machynlleth](/ecommerce-web-design-machynlleth/), [Builth Wells](/ecommerce-web-design-builth-wells/), [Hay-on-Wye](/ecommerce-web-design-hay-on-wye/), and the wider Mid Wales region.

Ecommerce sites start from **£800**, depending on your chosen platform, product catalogue size, and the functionality you need.

## Ecommerce platforms for Mid Wales businesses

We work across three platforms and always recommend what's right for your business specifically. Every build is fully custom-designed — not a template.

**Shopify** — the go-to choice for Mid Wales product businesses wanting a reliable, scalable store with minimal ongoing maintenance. We custom-design every Shopify store from scratch.

**WooCommerce** — WordPress-based and highly flexible. Ideal for businesses already on WordPress or those needing custom functionality that goes beyond standard ecommerce. Fully custom-designed.

**SureCart** — a modern platform suited to digital products, subscriptions, and service businesses that want to take online payments without managing a large product catalogue. Custom-designed.

## What's included in every Mid Wales ecommerce build

- Fully custom design tailored to your brand — no off-the-shelf themes
- Mobile-first development — most shoppers browse on their phones
- Secure checkout with payment gateway integration (Stripe, PayPal, and others)
- Easy product management — update your catalogue yourself after launch
- On-page SEO for product and category pages, ready for Google from day one
- Google Analytics and conversion tracking set up at launch

## Reaching beyond Mid Wales

Your online store can serve customers across Wales and the UK. We also build ecommerce sites for businesses in [North Wales](/ecommerce-web-design-north-wales/), [South Wales](/ecommerce-web-design-south-wales/), and across the wider [Wales region](/ecommerce-web-design-wales/).

